msgstr "garder les spatules de ski relevées"

#. module: base_iso7010_data_mandatory
#: model:iso7010.symbol,description:base_iso7010_data_mandatory.iso7010_symbol_m036
msgid "Indicates that ski tips must be kept up."
msgstr "Indique que les spatules de ski doivent être maintenues relevées."

#. module: base_iso7010_data_mandatory
#: model:iso7010.symbol,name:base_iso7010_data_mandatory.iso7010_symbol_m037
